@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Services}/{GlobalValues.Serivce_Path_Part_Live_Region}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Service_Name_Live_Region @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.Service_Name_Live_Region @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</h1>

<p>
    The Live Region Service allows you to send announcements to ARIA live regions, which are monitored by assistive technologies. These technologies
    then relay this information to their users; for example, screen readers will output the text as speech.
</p>

<p>
    <strong>Important: </strong>In order to use the Live Region Service, you need to ensure that is has been registered in the <span class="code-span">Program.cs</span> file (Both server and client
    if using Server and WebAssembly interactive rendermode) and that the <span class="code-span">&lt;AnnouncementHistory /&gt;</span> component has been added as it contains the live regions used.
    Please see the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Getting_Started">@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_About - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Getting_Started</a> page for details.
</p>

<p>
    <b>Try it:</b> Click the Theme button (top right of the screen, really an aria switch) which uses the live region service, then use the short cut keys <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>H</kbd> or click the alerts button at the bottom
    right of the screen to open the announcement history dialog to see the entry made.
</p>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Framework_Name_Modal - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Services}/{GlobalValues.Serivce_Path_Part_Live_Region}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Installation}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Service_Name_Live_Region - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Installation</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
